  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "50款都不是小游戏，每款从标题画面做到结局字幕",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "50 BRAND NEW GAMES - These are NOT minigames or microgames! Although the size of each game varies, every one is a complete experience, from its opening title screen to its ending credits.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1147860/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "虚构80年代厂商串起续作、角色与共享世界线",
      "dimension": "故事",
      "excerpt": "According to the story of UFO 50, the games were all created by a fictional 80s video game company that was obscure but ahead of its time. Some games are sequels to other games in the collection and various characters appear in multiple titles as part of a shared continuity.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1147860/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "统一32色调还原80年代质感，同时放开现代玩法设计",
      "dimension": "画风",
      "excerpt": "Every game shares a unique 32-color palette and we took great efforts to make them look and sound like actual 8-bit titles from the 80s. On the other hand, it was important to us that UFO 50 was fun and surprising for modern players, so we chose not to limit ourselves to the genres and design conventions of the past.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1147860/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
